          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Editing as an art form was born in online fandom spaces. AMV, which stands for Anime Music Video, is the long-form version of edits, and was found on Youtube."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [],
      "uuid": "75cfb1bd-76c6-4afc-b955-03831bf969b0"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 40,
      "end_time": 60,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": " AMV truly is the conception of edits as we know it to be today."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [],
      "uuid": "fc9ee4f0-f6a7-4b02-ae06-9a37ffdfb776"
    },
    {
